2. modify the Software or create derivative works based on it;
3. distribute, sublicense, sell, rent, or otherwise make the Software available
   to third parties;
4. use all or part of the Software for any commercial purpose, including but not
   limited to live trading, managing funds for others, investment advisory, or
   any form of service provided to others;
5. use the Software to train machine learning models or to build datasets.

